    "comment_data": [
        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\n`t` is reserved for [treesitter target](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/c8922aef8207137e66c80acdb9523668599ba62a/doc/mini-bracketed.txt#L57). It is intentional because tabpage navigation is already possible with `gt` and `gT`. As those are long standing built-in mappings, I think it is better for users in the long term to get used to them.\r\n\r\nClosing as not planned.",
